{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1475292-alchemical-exalts-and-exotic-materials","id":1475292,"title":"Alchemical Exalts and Exotic Materials","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Alchemical Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-22T20:48:41-08:00","id":1475292,"title":"Alchemical Exalts and Exotic Materials","content":"Just suppose, after Autocthonia reconnects with Creation, someone with clout sees artifacts made of exotic materials, sees Exigent Exalted, looks at her Champions, and goes &quot;Hey, what if we tried this...?&quot;; Exigent Alchemicals, getting around the Magical Materials shortage with alternative resources. Workable idea?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-23T06:51:34-08:00","id":1475316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1475292-alchemical-exalts-and-exotic-materials#post1475292\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just suppose, after Autocthonia reconnects with Creation, someone with clout sees artifacts made of exotic materials, sees Exigent Exalted, looks at her Champions, and goes &quot;Hey, what if we tried this...?&quot;; Exigent Alchemicals, getting around the Magical Materials shortage with alternative resources. Workable idea?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, i would say that the big challenge is making a correlation alchemicals - exalted - magic materials - exigents, as that requires a bunch of leaps of logic (and possibly meta-knowledge) for the dots to connect in a certain way in the first place. Damn, without foreknowledge of the exalted, what they are and alchemicals as &quot;the mechanical exalted&quot;, even defining an &quot;order of associations&quot; for the parts to connect and a person to jump at the conclusion you want is kind of difficult to define in the first place, imho.... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-01T06:02:15-07:00","id":1521810,"title":"","content":"I think something that might be interesting and a way I might go with if I were to run a scenario like this.<br /> <br /> the exaltations themselves are weaved into the very fabric of creation and the wyld and as long as the &quot;source&quot; of those exaltations is connected in some way to either creation or the wyld new exaltations will &quot;popup&quot; during times of great strife and need. Once Auto reconnects the basic pattern for the Alchemical Exalted is written into the universe(s?) itself and can be intuitively used by beings powerful enough to sustain at least 1 exaltation flavored through their lens of what that being is.<br /> <br /> this obviously a house rule","signature":"","edited":{"userid":359,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","user":"Dezeroth","date":". 09-01-2023, 09:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-11T03:06:42-07:00","id":1522392,"title":"","content":"It's no more (or less) likely than, say, Solar (or Abyssal) Exigents. It's not a matter of copying the design. It's a matter of exigent design being based on the god that empowered it. It's been mentioned more than once that most beings aren't really able to &quot;design&quot; their Exalted - what comes out is just a natural consequence of who/what the bestower of the exaltation <b>is</b>. So, yes, mechanical exigents,and/or ones based on magical metals are completely possible - for deities for whom it is &quot;in theme&quot;. They won't be any more Alchemical exigents than, say, Janest is a Solar one.<br /> Now, Autochthon himself <i>could</i> probably redesign his exalted in order to create some variants based on other than base 6 magic materials. Redesigning stuff (including himself) is part of who he is, after all. Autochthonians however probably cannot deviate from the divine pattern to this degree. The exaltation just would not catalyze.<br /> ...unless, of course, against all expectations suddenly it <i>did</i>, and now everyone's scrambling over themselves to understand what it means.<br /> In short: generally unlikely to happen, unless you find the idea so appealing you <i>really</i> need to put it into your game. In which case, sure, why not? Just do it knowing that it's very likely a major deviation of how it should work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><i>The difference between fiction and reality? Fiction has to make sense.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/434-astralporing","name":"Astralporing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar434_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"296"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}